# 说明

## 外部约束

+ 你可以使用以下外部约束：
  + `cst_base`
  + `cst_user`
  + `cst_case`

```systemverilog
constraint {{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree::cst_base {
    ...
}
constraint {{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree::cst_user {
    ...
}
constraint {{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree::cst_case {
    ...
}
```

{% if first_clk_name %}
## 时钟

开关时钟或改变频率，以 {{ first_clk_name }} 为例（详见 `trees.sv`）。

```systemverilog
constraint {{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ first_clk_tree_name }}_tree::cst_user {
    {{ first_clk_name }}.enabled; // 打开时钟
    {{ first_clk_name }}.frequence == 123456000; // 频率123.456Mhz
}
```

{% endif %}
## 建立与使用

在平台中建立 `{{ settings.class_prefix }}agent`，放入构建后的 `{{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree`

```systemverilog
{{ settings.class_prefix }}agent clk_agt;
{{ settings.class_prefix }}kit_sequencer clk_sqr;
{{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree tree;

function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);
    ...
    clk_agt = {{ settings.class_prefix }}agent::type_id::create("clk_agt", this);
    tree = {{ settings.class_prefix }}{{ trees[0].name }}_tree::type_id::create("tree");
{%- if regs_enabled %}
    tree.build(your_regmodel);
{%- else %}
    tree.build();
{%- endif %}
    $cast(clk_sqr, clk_agt.sqr); // 取出工具方便使用
    uvm_config_db#({{ settings.class_prefix }}tree_base)::set(this, "clk_agt", "tree", tree);
endfunction
```

使用快捷函数

```systemverilog
task main_phase(uvm_phase phase);
    phase.raise_objection(this);
    ...
{%- if any_node_path %}
    clk_sqr.check_freq();
    clk_sqr.check_duty();
{%- elif regs_enabled %}
    clk_sqr.config_reg();
{%- endif %}
    ...
endtask
```

{% if any_node_path %}
## 顶层连线

添加连线文件到模块顶层

```systemverilog
module your-top-module;
    ...
    `include "path-to-clock-tree/top/tree_connection.sv"
    ...
endmodule
```

在平台中连接 tree 与 interface

```systemverilog
function void build_phase(uvm_phase phase);
    ...
    your-top-module.{{ settings.class_prefix }}connect_{{ trees[0].name }}_tree(tree);
endfunction
```

